  _udonSharpBackingUdonBehaviour: {fileID: 850950191}
  dialogueLines:
  - Welcome to Centaurus!
  - I'm here to introduce some things before you start your journey!
  - See the star chart?
  - It tracks your own progress across centaurus which planets you've visited and
    which activities you've completed so far.
  - To travel anywhere, head to one of the rocket rooms nearby.
  - Rockets launch automatically once full, or you can catch the solo rocket if you're
    travelling alone.
  - Each planet needs a group of at least three to take part in its activities, so
    it helps to team up with others before you launch.
  - If you or your group share something new during an activity, it gets added to
    that planet's credit record with your name on it, recognising real contributions.
  - Hope you have a good experience!
  - Good luck and have Fun!
  dialogueText: {fileID: 1878755711}
  dialoguePanel: {fileID: 868906051}
  nextButton: {fileID: 1954821239}
